28:39.400 --> 28:40.160
Quzhuo.

28:40.590 --> 28:41.830
Tolong jaga Qinlan.

28:42.240 --> 28:44.000
Saya pasti akan membawanya
balik dengan selamat.

28:44.000 --> 28:45.800
Kakak, saya pergi bersama awak.

28:55.030 --> 28:55.980
Hongye!

28:58.510 --> 28:59.310
Hongye!

29:04.240 --> 29:05.000
Hongye!

29:06.750 --> 29:07.590
Hongye!

29:11.790 --> 29:12.720
Awak dah datang.

29:24.040 --> 29:28.270
♪ Roh yang merayau dalam takdir ♪

29:29.430 --> 29:31.750
